<h1>Forgotten Fantasy</h1>

<i>Forgotten Fantasy</i>, a digest-size US magazine, was
one of the last reprint fantasy magazines; it died in the middle
of publishing a serial (<i>Hartmann, the Anarchist</i>, which
was supposed to be a two-parter.)
